722 0 obj
<</Title(The IEEE Computer Society Uva Wellassa University Student Branch Chapter is a thriving group of enthusiastic undergraduates who are motivated by innovation, curiosity, and teamwork. As a recognized chapter under the world\220s largest professional association for advancing technology, it provides students with a unique platform to explore computing technologies, software engineering, and emerging digital fields while gaining hands-on experience beyond the classroom. The chapter creates an atmosphere in which students can sharpen their problem-solving abilities, cultivate their leadership skills, and interact with scholars and industry experts through workshops, seminars, hackathons, and technical projects. It serves as a link between theory and practice, enabling students to develop into creative thinkers who can make significant contributions to technical growth on a national and international level.)/Dest[13 0 R/Fit]/Parent 617 0 R>>
endobj

